        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "What to Expect When You're Expecting , 5th edition, Heidi Murkoff. WhatToExpect.com, Your Baby's Tiny Ears Are Tuning In — Here's When Hearing Develops in the Womb , October 2025. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, The National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health (NIOSH), About Noise and Reproductive Health , December 2023. National Institutes of Health, National Library of Medicine, Development of the Auditory System , October 2015.",
        "text_sha256": "f4696d52249191e1981eb4e996cbf5f1287004e40ac8dce33d0437a311b77f40",
