        "text": "How Much Caffeine Is Safe During Pregnancy? The Sneaky Sources That Put Moms-to-Be Over the Limit Medically Reviewed by Alexandra Paetow, M.S., R.D.N.",
        "text_sha256": "39af291e2befda47426b4bcf6f7b8d3625044d2ed01516ca76499da4760bc21f",
